    text: Red-first fixtures confirmed quoted pins passed the verifier while the prepare step left them stale and the continuation guard accepted them. The shared parser reuses the shell scanner and edits only the option source spans. The workflow exercises quoted pins across a later-day retry and the pre-publication guard.
