    text: "Round FM thread map for PR #295, verified against starting head 22f8352. Commit 6446306 addresses all thirteen PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66P- threads. 56 preserves expression-valued environment uncertainty. 59 limits definite environment writes to recognized executing shell templates. 6D documents the hook-options check. 6F classifies tee destinations. 6K refuses alternate custom notes renderers while accepting an unconditional final renderer or prepared generator branches. 6N consumes the lexer-decoded here-document delimiters with physical edit offsets. 6P preserves the selected JSON and step-output path. 6W uses the active npm configuration loader and records unknown when unresolved. 6X re-detects the verified project for empty and absent legacy receipt values. 6f accepts timeout -p. 6l copies Node to a spaced executable path and exercises the .exe entry point. 6o verifies the next untagged version heading. 6r sets one explicit lifecycle environment for preparation and real npm execution. Prior binding threads 650IRm and 650SdF are covered by 24d844c and rechecked with the current code."
