    text: "Round GK gates passed with npm 11.21.0. The focused grammar, shell and date suites passed 228 of 228. The 30 reference suites passed 1553 with two opt-in skips. Both npm run coverage and node test/release-heading-full-gate.acceptance.ts passed 2253 of 2255 with two opt-in skips, zero failures and 100 percent statements, branches, functions and lines across 54 required sources. The initial standalone report collected counters across a source edit and was superseded by the frozen-source pass. Typecheck, test build, lint, zero duplication, docstrings, changelog check and release verifiers passed. The rewritten untagged release generated the expected 2026-11-17 heading in both outputs. The pinned fleet inventory accepted 142 hooks and 144 reachable bodies across 39 manifests. The preview, signing and invalid UTF-8 index controls passed. 9633e72 adds an accepted dynamic setup path for PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66j9ho."
